threads.body:
`gen_ai.tool.definitions` has requirement level `Opt-In` in semconv. It must not be emitted at all when content capture is disabled. The semconv note regarding non-required properties applies when the attribute is opted into, not as a reason to emit it unconditionally.

```suggestion
    if mode not in allowed_modes:
        return {}
```

